    "searchText": "orange lvl. contract: defend and escort employees orange lvl. contract: defend [objects] and escort employees foxwell_defendentitiesandescort_pyro_medium foxwell enforcement careercontract standing defend ship pickup: pyro we need a contractor to provide convoy and protection services at [location]. one of our elite clients' are under attack from a band of outlaws targeting their [objects] and ships. you'll need to keep the crew safe as they traverse the area, as well as make sure the assets stay as intact. these thugs look like they can do some real damage, so be sure you engage them with caution or the client might not be the only one to take heavy losses.\n\nif you manage to nail this to the foxwell standards, we’re offering [scripamount] mg scrip as compensation to the main contractor. \n\ngood luck,\n\neugene walton\ndispatcher, foxwell enforcement\n'security, your way'\n\nfoxwell enforcement is a bonded security specialist licensed to operate throughout the uee. we are always looking for new operators to join our family. if you or anyone you know is interested, please reach out to one of our contract representatives. orange lvl. contract: protect [objects] and escort employees red lvl. contract: defend [objects] and escort employees red lvl. contract: protect [objects] and escort employees yellow lvl. contract: defend [objects] and escort employees yellow lvl. contract: protect [objects] and escort employees 9731c308-24e7-4f31-abe0-10f2078483ab 8436bbb2-8057-4220-b75d-65cb9639389f d838d03b-8b38-48c6-956e-2017daae0aca ece88c3a-492e-478e-b7f2-fa3c80d8b643 359ac395-ea43-4849-9efa-45c704b8fd1a af3d21d8-c6a3-46c6-9f1b-fc1ceb5472c4 f4054178-9d89-4963-a801-387a902d5dc7 blueprint: pyro foxwell easy: ionwave, radix, ionburst, powerbolt +10 standing +150 207,000 auec item reward: mg scrip completion tag blueprint: pyro foxwell hard: glacier, avalanche, blizzard, dr model-xj1 repeater +2 standing +200 336,500 auec"
